{"version":1,"content":"<p>由內地藝人張凌赫、田曦薇主演劇集《逐玉》，劇中謝征（張凌赫飾）與樊長玉（田曦薇飾）從一紙契約婚姻走向真心相許。</p><p>其中兩大怦然心動畫面「陳皮糖之吻」及「墳前吹眼」，成為觀眾反覆回味的場面。</p><p>張凌赫與田曦薇受訪時，不約而同選出「陳皮糖之吻」為最愛名場面。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:00:34.311597+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:30:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T03:57:59.885423+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:56:35.407226+00:00","content_hash":"00a6343fcebad5018b46995461050e8de48169cba65c83aa1ef53a20cb8137df","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}